</a></div></div></div></section><section class="product-description entry-content" style="margin-top:2rem;"><h2 style="font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:1rem;" data-no-translation="" data-trp-gettext="">产品说明</h2><div itemprop="description"><h2 data-start="93" data-end="145"><strong data-start="96" data-end="143">(DCP）18% 磷酸二钙粉--饲料级</strong></h2><p data-start="146" data-end="387"><strong data-start="146" data-end="158">计算公式</strong> CaHPO₄-2H₂O | <strong data-start="173" data-end="185">化学文摘社编号</strong> 7757-93-9 | <strong data-start="198" data-end="219">分子量：</strong> 172.10<br data-start="353" data-end="356" /><strong data-start="356" data-end="369">标准：</strong> GB/T 22549-2017</p><hr data-start="389" data-end="392" /><h3 data-start="394" data-end="420"><strong data-start="398" data-end="418">磷酸二钙 (DCP) 18% - 产品概览</strong></h3><p data-start="421" data-end="742"><strong data-start="421" data-end="472"><a href="/product/dcp-dicalcium-phosphate-17/" data-internallinksmanager029f6b8e52c="5" title="DCP17">磷酸二钙</a> (DCP) 18% 粉末 <a href="/product/" data-internallinksmanager029f6b8e52c="4" title="饲料添加剂">饲料</a> 等级</strong> 是一种优质饲料添加剂，广泛用于家畜、家禽和水产养殖业。它是一种重要的 <strong data-start="591" data-end="627">钙磷来源</strong>这两种重要的矿物质有助于骨骼的强健发育、最佳的生长性能和动物的整体健康。</p><p data-start="744" data-end="973">该产品按照严格的质量标准生产，可确保 <strong data-start="806" data-end="835">极佳的生物利用率</strong>, <strong data-start="837" data-end="864">重金属含量低</strong>和 <strong data-start="870" data-end="901">高柠檬酸溶解度</strong>使其成为全球动物营养计划的可靠选择。</p><hr data-start="975" data-end="978" /><h3 data-start="980" data-end="1022"><strong data-start="984" data-end="1020">DCP 18% 主要规格 </strong></h3><ul data-start="1023" data-end="1564"><li data-start="1023" data-end="1080"><p data-start="1025" data-end="1080"><strong data-start="1025" data-end="1050">总磷 (P)：</strong> ≥18.0% | <strong data-start="1060" data-end="1071">结果</strong> 18.23%</p></li><li data-start="1081" data-end="1161"><p data-start="1083" data-end="1161"><strong data-start="1083" data-end="1136">可用磷（2% 柠檬酸溶解度）：</strong> ≥90% | <strong data-start="1144" data-end="1155">结果</strong> 99%</p></li><li data-start="1162" data-end="1209"><p data-start="1164" data-end="1209"><strong data-start="1164" data-end="1181">钙 (Ca)：</strong> ≥20% | <strong data-start="1189" data-end="1200">结果</strong> 22.27%</p></li><li data-start="1210" data-end="1258"><p data-start="1212" data-end="1258"><strong data-start="1212" data-end="1229">氟 (F)：</strong> ≤0.18% | <strong data-start="1239" data-end="1250">结果</strong> 0.15%</p></li><li data-start="1259" data-end="1309"><p data-start="1261" data-end="1309"><strong data-start="1261" data-end="1278">砷（As）：</strong> ≤30 ppm | <strong data-start="1289" data-end="1300">结果</strong> 13 ppm</p></li><li data-start="1310" data-end="1356"><p data-start="1312" data-end="1356"><strong data-start="1312" data-end="1326">铅 (Pb)：</strong> ≤30 ppm | <strong data-start="1337" data-end="1348">结果</strong> 7 ppm</p></li><li data-start="1357" data-end="1408"><p data-start="1359" data-end="1408"><strong data-start="1359" data-end="1376">镉 (Cd)：</strong> ≤10 ppm | <strong data-start="1387" data-end="1398">结果</strong> 百万分之 1.3</p></li><li data-start="1409" data-end="1465"><p data-start="1411" data-end="1465"><strong data-start="1411" data-end="1442">pH 值（2.4 克/升水溶液）：</strong> &gt;7 | <strong data-start="1448" data-end="1459">结果</strong> 7.5</p></li><li data-start="1466" data-end="1504"><p data-start="1468" data-end="1504"><strong data-start="1468" data-end="1481">湿度</strong> ≤4% | <strong data-start="1488" data-end="1499">结果</strong> 1%</p></li><li data-start="1505" data-end="1564"><p data-start="1507" data-end="1564"><strong data-start="1507" data-end="1539">粒度（通过 500 μm）：</strong> ≥90% | <strong data-start="1547" data-end="1558">结果</strong> 95%</p></li></ul><hr data-start="1566" data-end="1569" /><h3 data-start="980" data-end="1022"><img src="/images/uploads/2025/09/DCP18-Powder-4-300x300.jpg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-516 size-medium" alt="(DCP）18% 磷酸二钙粉--饲料级" width="300" height="300" /></h3><hr data-start="2207" data-end="2210" /><h3 data-start="2212" data-end="2234"><strong data-start="2216" data-end="2232">应用</strong></h3><ul data-start="2235" data-end="2663"><li data-start="2235" data-end="2353"><p data-start="2237" data-end="2353"><strong data-start="2237" data-end="2253">家禽饲料</strong> - 增强蛋壳强度，支持肉鸡快速生长，提高产蛋性能。</p></li><li data-start="2354" data-end="2470"><p data-start="2356" data-end="2470"><strong data-start="2356" data-end="2374">牲畜饲料</strong> - 促进牛、猪、绵羊和山羊的骨骼强度、增重和饲料效率。</p></li><li data-start="2471" data-end="2561"><p data-start="2473" data-end="2561"><strong data-start="2473" data-end="2488">水产养殖</strong> - 为鱼虾的生长和生存提供必需的矿物质。</p></li><li data-start="2562" data-end="2663"><p data-start="2564" data-end="2663"><strong data-start="2564" data-end="2581">宠物营养</strong> - 为狗、猫和其他伴侣动物提供均衡的矿物质补充剂。</p></li></ul><hr data-start="2665" data-end="2668" /><h3 data-start="2670" data-end="2700"><strong data-start="2674" data-end="2698">储存和保质期</strong></h3><ul data-start="2701" data-end="2843"><li data-start="2701" data-end="2770"><p data-start="2703" data-end="2770">存放在 <strong data-start="2714" data-end="2748">凉爽、干燥和通风的地方</strong> 远离湿气。</p></li><li data-start="2771" data-end="2843"><p data-start="2773" data-end="2843">保质期 <strong data-start="2785" data-end="2798">24 个月</strong> 在正确存放的情况下，可从生产日期起保存数年。</p></li></ul><hr data-start="2845" data-end="2848" /><h3 data-start="2850" data-end="2895"><strong data-start="2854" data-end="2893">为什么选择我们的磷酸二钙 (</strong><strong data-start="984" data-end="1020">DCP) 18%</strong><strong data-start="2854" data-end="2893">?</strong></h3><ul data-start="2896" data-end="3122"><li data-start="2896" data-end="2953"><p data-start="2898" data-end="2953">符合 <strong data-start="2914" data-end="2951">GB/T 22549-2017 国家标准</strong></p></li><li data-start="2954" data-end="3008"><p data-start="2956" data-end="3008">测试和验证 <strong data-start="2983" data-end="3006"